    "Keep SR_OE high on startup; clear, shift and latch before enabling outputs.",
    "SPI1 EEPROM target <=1MHz; shift-register control target <=100kHz. Timing not simulated.",
    "Unused GPIOs must be set to analog input or appropriate defined state; preserve SWD pins.",
    "BOOT0 and BOOT1 pulldowns select main flash; bootloader mode is not exposed.",
    "Debounce user switch; no functional firmware is included in this visual-board change."
